    "post": "GADVASU Non-Teaching Recruitment 2026 — Advertisement No. 03/2026",
    "shortInfo": "**GADVASU Non-Teaching Recruitment 2026 — Advertisement No. 03/2026**. Vacancy: 45 posts total: Steno Typist 15; Clerk 20; Storekeeper 10. Post counts are from official Advertisement No. 03/2026. Eligibility: Steno Typist: Bachelor's degree from a recognized university; at least 120-hour computer course with hands-on experience in personal computer/office productivity/desktop publishing from a government-recognized or ISO-9001-certified reputed institution, OR DOEACC 'O' Level-equivalent course; Punjabi matriculation from a recognized board (as first/second/additional language or accepted equivalent) by the application deadline. Clerk: same degree, computer and Punjabi requirements. Storekeeper: Bachelor's degree with Economics, B.Com. or B.B.A.; same computer and Punjabi requirements. Read each post's official eligibility PDF for full conditions. Last date: 08/10/2026 04:00 PM — online application and fee payment deadline (closed) Fee, age relaxation, selection process और required documents के लिए official notification को अंतिम मानें.",
