    "categoryVacancy": "Official Advertisement No. 03/2026 lists post-wise totals only in its summary: Steno Typist 15, Clerk 20, Storekeeper 10 (45 total). The accessible summary/general-instructions page does not provide a reliable category-wise numeric roster; do not infer category counts. Reservation is governed by Punjab Government/University rules and requires valid supporting certificates. Check the official post attachments and any later corrigendum.",
    "feeDate": "08/10/2026 04:00 PM — online application and fee payment deadline (as revised by Corrigendum-I).",
